This is the Organisation's default and it grants nothing, which is the point: it states the
position a repository is already in when it carries no licence at all, rather than leaving that
position unsaid. A repository that should be open replaces this file wholesale with the licence
it means — and records why in its own `docs/adr/`. Withholding rights is reversible; granting
them is not.
